### ==============================================================================
### CycleAware - Feedback API Testing Suite
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client extension and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ==============================================================================

### 1. GET All Feedback (Ordered by ID Descending)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test CORS Preflight for Feedback Endpoint
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

###

### 3. POST New Verified Feedback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Divya & Friends",
  "overallRating": 5,
  "destinationAccuracyRating": 5,
  "budgetCalculatorRating": 5,
  "comments": "The CycleAware pacing recommendations were wonderful for our trip along NH 44. Padmanabhapuram Palace buffer time was spot on!",
  "suggestedPlaces": "Lemur Beach, Muttam"
}

###

### 4. GET Destinations (Sanity Check)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/destinations
Accept: application/json

